DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260520T003000
UID:e14452b80744ff8725830c288a1c7929@madamsorgan.com
DESCRIPTION:American Darling blends swaggering soul songs\, with intoxicat
 ing rock music\, and traditional blues. Led by singer and guitarist Ryan M
 oran\, this up and coming five piece takes their inspiration from greats l
 ike the Allman Brothers\, Grateful Dead\, Little Feat and The Band. This t
 win guitar powerhouse is not to be missed.
LOCATION:Madam's Organ Blues Bar\, 2461 18th Street NW\, Washington\, DC 2
 0009
URL:https://madamsorgan.com/events/moran-tripp-band-2/
X-SOURCE:Madam's Organ
