DESCRIPTION:Happening every Wednesday night on the second floor. Bring you
 r instrument\, bring your voice\, bring your friends and rock out on the m
 icrophone. We welcome singers\, rappers\, poets\, spoken word artist\, com
 edians\, musicians the whole nine yards. Background band available to acco
 mpany\, backline equipment available for musicians. Sign Up Sheet Opens At
  8:30\, Show Starts At 9pm
LOCATION:Madam's Organ Blues Bar\, 2461 18th Street NW\, Washington\, DC 2
 0009
